I think the previous posts on this were a little unclear.  Should you
donate money to a priest not of your alignment, you will still get the
same obvious effects (raising of AC, clairvoyance, &c), but you will
not improve your alignment status.  This can only be improved by
donating to a co-aligned priest or making a sacrifice.  Your god will
not be offended by any such actions.  I'm not sure if it's the
priest's alignment or that of the altar that are important.

